<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia's M3 money supply up 2.1 percent in March.</title>
<headline>Zambia's M3 money supply up 2.1 percent in March.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply rose by 2.1 percent in March after a 3.2 percent increase in February, the central bank said.</p>
<p>			   Mar 1997	  Feb 1997	  Mar 1996</p>
<p>M3 (kwacha million)  590,737.8	 578,410.1	 468,099.3</p>
<p>-- Lusaka Newsroom: + 260 1 222-689</p>
</text>
